OL,3,AUS interest rates raised for first time
OL,4,Ain three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS interest rates have been raised for
OL,7,Fthe first time in more than three years
OL,8,Fand could be increased further in a bid
OL,9,Fto slow rising prices.
OL,11,FRates were hiked to 3.75%-4% from
OL,12,F3.5%-3.75% by the Federal Reserve in a
OL,13,Funanimous decision, despite fierce
OL,14,Fopposition from President Donald Trump,
OL,15,Fwho had called for rates to be cut.
OL,17,FFed Chair Kevin Warsh said the move was
OL,18,Fbecause "inflation is too high and has
OL,19,Fbeen for too long", adding that it was
OL,20,Fa "sober" and "responsible decision".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
